Added an MCP server, `plone-client mcp`, in the new `mcp` extra: it serves the selected profile over standard input and output, or several sites at once with `--site`, `--group`, or `--all`, offering the everyday reads, the high-level operations, and one tool for any other `plone.restapi` service; changes to read-only profiles are refused. Profiles can now be gathered into named groups in the configuration file, managed with `plone-client profile groups`, `group-set`, and `group-remove`. @ericof
